Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 23:15:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(fsdpturbo): add fixed-rollout GRPO training, online
 weight publication and sharded checkpoint

Add fixed-rollout GRPO actor updates through BatchBuilder, HF disk weight
publication with SGLang GRPO integration validation, and sharded model/AdamW
checkpoints with trainer continuation validation.
